// Nervus standard interface · BaseMotion@1  [REWRITE-v1 / experimental]
//
// interface_id = nervus.interface.motion.base, major = 1, experimental.
//   Feature     = nervus.feature.motion.base
//   Permission  = perm.motion.control
//   Resource    = nervus.resource.motion.base (role such as main)
//
// Robot dogs use this standard interface: body velocity → gait (NRCP §17.2), the motion main line of demo 26.
//
